  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given equation of plane,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>We know that equation of family of planes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8869;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8756;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>So, equation of plane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>It passes through the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
